# Synchroteam Middleware — HTTP Requests
# Use this file in JetBrains Rider, IntelliJ HTTP Client, or VS Code REST Client extension.
#
# Prerequisites to run the middleware locally:
# - Configure Synchroteam settings via one of the following:
#   - Environment variables for the middleware process:
#       SYNCHROTEAM_BASE_URL (e.g., https://ws.synchroteam.com)
#       SYNCHROTEAM_DOMAIN (your Synchroteam domain/company)
#       SYNCHROTEAM_LOGIN (your Synchroteam login/username)
#       SYNCHROTEAM_API_KEY (your Synchroteam API key; used as password for Basic Auth)
#   - Or set values in Synchroteam/Middleware/appsettings.json under the "Synchroteam" section
# - Run the middleware project (Synchroteam.Middleware)
# - Default ASP.NET Core Kestrel ports are typically 5000 (http) and 5001 (https)

### Variables / Environments
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create or upsert a customer (synchroteamId = 0 => create)
POST {{host}}/sync-to-st/customer
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "synchroteamId": 0,
  "sourceId": "028257",
  "name": "Jose Martinez",
  "addressComplement": "",
  "addressCity": "Benito Juarez",
  "addressCountry": "MX",
  "addressProvince": "CDMX",
  "addressStreet": "Uxmal 77B 301, Santa Cruz Atoyac",
  "addressZip": "03310",
  "contactEmail": "manolo@itia.mx",
  "contactFirstName": "Jose",
  "contactFax": "",
  "contactPhone": "+52-55-5964-8139",
  "contactLastName": "Martinez",
  "vatNumber": "",
  "publicLink": "https://example.com/customer/028257",
  "position": { "longitude": "-99.162", "latitude": "19.387" },
  "tags": ["priority", "vip"],
  "active": true
}

### Update (upsert) existing customer by Synchroteam numeric Id
POST {{host}}/sync-to-st/customer
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "synchroteamId": 42,
  "sourceId": "cust-123",
  "name": "Acme Corp International",
  "addressComplement": "HQ Tower, Floor 10",
  "addressCity": "Gotham",
  "addressCountry": "US",
  "addressProvince": "NJ",
  "addressStreet": "100 New Ave",
  "addressZip": "07001",
  "contactEmail": "ops@acme.com",
  "contactFirstName": "Alice",
  "contactFax": "",
  "contactPhone": "+1-555-0100",
  "contactLastName": "Doe",
  "vatNumber": "US123456789",
  "publicLink": "https://example.com/customer/cust-123",
  "position": { "longitude": "-74.245", "latitude": "40.558" },
  "tags": ["enterprise"],
  "active": true
}

### Negative test: minimal invalid body (likely fails validation when added)
POST {{host}}/sync-to-st/customer
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "synchroteamId": 0
}

